<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MBIA cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MBIA cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it had cut its rating for MBIA Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the bond insurance and investment management firm closed on Wednesday at 96-1/2, close to its 12-month high of 96-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
